{#
    Inline-edit success (design-neutral). Refreshes the page, as the other flows do after a
    save (TurboAwareRedirector): the server renders it again, so the field shows its display mode
    and every other copy of the value (a breadcrumb, a heading) is current. The flash set on save
    shows on the refreshed page, wherever the app's layout renders flashes.

    Variables:
    - context    (InlineEditContext)
    - value      deprecated: the stored value read back after saving, when the controller passed a Closure; else null
    - mirrorText deprecated: that value as text, or null when there is nothing to mirror
#}
<turbo-stream action="refresh"></turbo-stream>
